@startuml Incident State Machine
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #444444
  FontName Helvetica
  ArrowColor #555555
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4AF37

title Incident Lifecycle

[*] --> Open : Reporter submits ticket

Open --> Acknowledged : Solver acknowledges
Acknowledged --> InProgress : Solver starts work
InProgress --> Resolved : Solver marks resolved
Resolved --> Closed : Solver closes
Resolved --> Open : Reopened
Closed --> Open : Reopened

Closed --> [*]

state Open {
  Open : Ticket filed and waiting for a team member
}
state Acknowledged {
  Acknowledged : A solver has seen the ticket and taken ownership
}
state "In Progress" as InProgress {
  InProgress : Solver is actively working on it
}
state Resolved {
  Resolved : Fix applied, awaiting confirmation
}
state Closed {
  Closed : Confirmed fixed, no further action
}

note right of Open
  Only solvers can change state.
  Reporters may edit details and
  add comments in any state.
end note

note bottom of Closed
  Every successful transition writes an
  IncidentUpdate row recording the user,
  the old state, the new state, and the time.
end note

note left of Resolved
  Reopening returns the ticket to Open
  and clears resolved_at. It must then
  pass through every state again.
end note

legend right
  |= Rule |= Effect |
  | States must be visited in order | Open to Resolved is rejected |
  | No backward moves except Reopen | In Progress to Open is rejected |
  | Reopen only from Resolved or Closed | Acknowledged to Open is rejected |
  | Same-state transition | Rejected as no change |
endlegend

@enduml
